WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
 - So if we were to meet up next year at

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.080
 this time,

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.720
 what would be awesome?

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.050
 Like, what would we be saying that would

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:06.320
 be like,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.880
 I can't believe this happened?

