 - What I would love to see is double the

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.080
 size.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:12.920
 - Yes, what?

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.760
 - Double the size.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.240
 Double the number of people at the table.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.080
 - Okay.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.790
 - Double the number of people that we've

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:19.620
 screened.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.980
 Triple the number of people that we've

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:22.440
 identified

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.750
 and help get their blood pressure under

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.160
 control.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.260
 You know, just really see this start to

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:27.720
 take off.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.920
 That would be wonderful.

